  <p class="body-lg reveal" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Management consultants have trained it out of companies. Nobody has problems any more — only challenges. We get the call when a challenge comes up that not just any agency can solve. Only one with industry knowledge. Strategic understanding. Market know-how.</p>
</section>

<section class="container" style="padding-block:1rem 3rem;max-width:760px;">
  <h2 class="display-md reveal" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Mittelstand in the German sense</h2>
  <p class="body-lg reveal" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">What is meant is not a size class in a statistic but a type of company: owner-managed or family-owned, active internationally, often with revenues in the hundreds of millions – and not infrequently world market leader in its own niche. Decisions there are made quickly and at the level of management or the owning family.</p>
  <p class="body-lg reveal reveal-delay-1" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">That is exactly where the agency comes in: with occasions that management decides itself – a <a href="/en/services/brand-relaunch/" style="color:var(--accent);">brand relaunch</a> after an acquisition or generational change, a <a href="/en/services/product-launch/" style="color:var(--accent);">product launch</a>, the step into <a href="/en/services/international-markets/" style="color:var(--accent);">new markets</a>. The focus is on <a href="/en/automotive-advertising-agency/" style="color:var(--accent);">automotive</a> and <a href="/en/mechanical-engineering-advertising-agency/" style="color:var(--accent);">mechanical engineering</a>.</p>
</section>

<section class="container" style="padding-block:1rem 3rem;max-width:760px;">
  <h2 class="display-md reveal" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Diagnosis, concept, execution – in that order</h2>
  <p class="body-lg reveal" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Many enquiries start with a measure: a new logo, a website, an image film. Whether that measure solves the actual problem only becomes clear in the diagnosis. What does the brand have to achieve after the acquisition, the generational change or the market entry – and what of that does it not achieve today?</p>
  <p class="body-lg reveal reveal-delay-1" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">The diagnosis leads to the concept, the concept to the execution: corporate design, website, sales collateral, video. Concept and design sit in the same team. What was decided in the concept is not lost on the way to the finished presence.</p>
  <p class="body-lg reveal reveal-delay-1" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Diagnosis and concept are an integral part of every mandate – not unbilled groundwork for a design commission. The client knows in advance what they will get. Anyone looking for strategic brand consulting alone is in the right place with <a href="https://luenstroth.com/">Lünstroth brand consultancy</a>.</p>
</section>

